{"path":"identifier_with_special_meaning/final","title":"C++ identifier with special meaning: final (since C++11)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">C++ identifier with special meaning:</span><code>final</code><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/identifier_with_special_meaning/final","section":"identifier_with_special_meaning","kind":"page","summary":"","html":"<h3 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/final\"><code>final</code></a> specifier\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> b0 final <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> d0 <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> b0 <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// Error: cannot derive from final base</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> b1\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">virtual</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f0<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> final<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">virtual</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f1<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> d1 <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> b1 <span class=\"co1\">// OK</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f0<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// Error: cannot override final function</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f1<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// OK</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre>\n